   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello,<br><br>The labels of x ticks in my plot is too long and they overlapped. How can I make the distance between x ticks larger?<br><br>Thanks,<br clear=\"all\"><br>Li<br>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "6yMpaxRfMDUJ",
   "from": "David Kahle",
   "author": "e4aec126ff1dca22",
   "date": "2009-11-28T17:05:14Z",
   "subject": "Re: how to adjust the distance between x ticks",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Check out the <span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:12px\">breaks <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">argument in <span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:12px\">scale_x_continuous<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">, e.g.</span></span></span></span><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(0,27,147)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">qplot</span>(<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span>, <span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">qplot<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">:</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">, </span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">:</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">) + </span>scale_x_continuous<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span>breaks<span style=\"color:#001b93\"> = </span>c<span style=\"color:#001b93\">(</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">1</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">5</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">,</span><span style=\"color:#224f1e\">10</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><font color=\"#001B93\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><font color=\"#001B93\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">Cheers</span></font></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium\">david.</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><br></span></font></div><div></div></div></div>"
    ],
